cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite the method below when using this software or its model, and
  record the software release or commit and model checksum used. Cite the
  versioned dataset separately when using published estimates.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/FatimaPillosu/probability_flash_flood
title: "Probability of Flash Flood (PoFF): ERA5-based inference"
authors:
  - family-names: Pillosu
    given-names: Fatima M.
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8127-0990
abstract: >-
  Standalone Python inference for daily flash-flood occurrence probabilities
  from ERA5 and ERA5-ecPoint predictors using a saved XGBoost classifier.
keywords:
  - flash floods
  - ERA5
  - ecPoint
  - XGBoost
  - probabilistic prediction
